---
// Member-facing Blog section. Rendered both as a standalone page
// (/account/blog) and inside the side-drawer on /account.
// Member-exclusive — deeper dives on platform changes, sector
// insight, and tactics, separate from the marketing /blog.
---

<div class="acc-section">
  <header class="acc-section-head">
    <div class="acc-blog-head-row">
      <div>
        <p class="acc-section-eyebrow">Members only</p>
        <h2 class="acc-section-title">Inside The Edit</h2>
        <p class="acc-section-sub">Long-form pieces written for the agencies inside the platform. Platform changes, tactics that are working right now, and what we're testing behind the scenes.</p>
      </div>
      <span class="acc-blog-flag">Exclusive</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <a class="acc-blog-hero" href="/account/blog#instagram-algo-2026">
    <div class="acc-blog-hero-art" style="background-image:url('/assets/social-media.png')"></div>
    <div class="acc-blog-hero-body">
      <span class="acc-blog-card-meta">Featured &middot; Platform update &middot; 6 min</span>
      <h3 class="acc-blog-hero-title">What just changed in the Instagram ranking signal &mdash; and what to do this week</h3>
      <p class="acc-blog-hero-desc">Instagram quietly bumped the weight of "shares to non-followers" in mid-May. For property accounts that's a bigger deal than it sounds. Here's what we're testing on managed accounts and the three caption changes you can make today.</p>
      <span class="acc-blog-card-cta">Read the piece <em>&rarr;</em></span>
    </div>
  </a>

  <div class="acc-blog-grid">
    <a class="acc-blog-card" href="/account/blog#sunday-window">
      <div class="acc-blog-card-art" style="background-image:url('/assets/cosy%20home.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="acc-blog-card-body">
        <span class="acc-blog-card-meta">Tactics &middot; 7 min</span>
        <h4 class="acc-blog-card-title">The Sunday-evening window: why our highest-engagement slot moved</h4>
        <p class="acc-blog-card-desc">Three months of data from 18 managed accounts on when property posts actually get seen now.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-blog-card" href="/account/blog#reels-vs-stills">
      <div class="acc-blog-card-art" style="background-image:url('/assets/home%20video.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="acc-blog-card-body">
        <span class="acc-blog-card-meta">Strategy &middot; 9 min</span>
        <h4 class="acc-blog-card-title">Reels vs. stills for &pound;1m+ listings: which actually pulls enquiries</h4>
        <p class="acc-blog-card-desc">We A/B'd 240 listings across price bands. The winner isn't the format you'd expect on prime stock.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-blog-card" href="/account/blog#linkedin-property">
      <div class="acc-blog-card-art" style="background-image:url('/assets/personal-brand.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="acc-blog-card-body">
        <span class="acc-blog-card-meta">Channel &middot; 5 min</span>
        <h4 class="acc-blog-card-title">Why most agencies should care about LinkedIn (and how to start without sounding corporate)</h4>
        <p class="acc-blog-card-desc">The audience that buys at the top of the market. Six post formats and three tone shifts that work.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-blog-card" href="/account/blog#brand-without-rebrand">
      <div class="acc-blog-card-art" style="background-image:url('/assets/home%20window.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="acc-blog-card-body">
        <span class="acc-blog-card-meta">Brand &middot; 8 min</span>
        <h4 class="acc-blog-card-title">How to look bigger without rebranding</h4>
        <p class="acc-blog-card-desc">Six small visual moves that make a one-office agency feel like a regional brand &mdash; without touching the logo.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-blog-card" href="/account/blog#valuations-as-content">
      <div class="acc-blog-card-art" style="background-image:url('/assets/home%20kitchen.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="acc-blog-card-body">
        <span class="acc-blog-card-meta">Content &middot; 6 min</span>
        <h4 class="acc-blog-card-title">Turning valuations into content: the agreement template we use</h4>
        <p class="acc-blog-card-desc">One-line addition to your valuation paperwork that unlocks an entire content pillar &mdash; legally, ethically, on-brand.</p>
      </div>
    </a>

    <a class="acc-blog-card" href="/account/blog#captions-prompt">
      <div class="acc-blog-card-art" style="background-image:url('/assets/social%20media.jpg')"></div>
      <div class="acc-blog-card-body">
        <span class="acc-blog-card-meta">AI &middot; 10 min</span>
